<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has intensified its campaign, destroying bridges in Arakan, pushing west of the Sittaung River, and planning a 108‑kilometre fence along the Bangladesh border while conducting airstrikes that hit a displacement camp in Rakhine state. In Sagaing, junta forces killed 11 people as Starlink outages isolated communities, and health-care facilities continued to be attacked throughout October 2026. Gold revenues are now being used to fund resistance groups, though at a steep cost to those groups. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQRTlfZHlvVHdUZ0FTeVlwa0YxamF6cmNKeXZ2eHlFSTYxN3RjREdhZU50MW0tSXdoWkkyXzJncUxCSTlVZGRpMzAzWmc2WUJNRnZkNEE0OUlWVFZMckNpUnM1R2RDd0F1YXNwOGNNUjIySDB2ZUJ0d2EwY202UldyaG1YUjhrMDJHX2ZCalF1UWNaUEhTdHJEc3VrUGlWdVdrNktFOF9aNnpGRGJkeV9rVUxmSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNOUhpSk5WcDVTeHZwVHlUc2Q2Q1BLQTk3YVg5VTM1QkxRSXlHMVl1SGRGM2NkajRGbDQ2RVBkN05GOGtZV0x0U1dQeE91anRrM0NCY01GckFqTGc2RGJ4aGVyeVo3dkJLVTFCVnpacHdROU5YWXJuV0RpM2RYeHBBMW9KWjk5WWlqTUNtdXFvalNBQnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOTnpzYzQzYjdfaUJPWHctemRJbWpSb1pRZHRtbFZjWTVXN05fNmxMQWRINDBpTHJqRW41STVZSlJ1R19iYXFZbEprOFBrRDV1Uk5RemtGN3VPb0Z0dFd4NnJGcDdxcGc4NjFBRTBNc1NjcWx0blJQZ090OUR3bGhYekZjRHVNU0xKWF9R?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
